---------------------------------------------------------------------------
External dependencies
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

This plugin bundles no third-party code. It installs or uses the following,
each under its own license and not covered by the license above:

  cava              (MIT)     audio spectrum for music reactivity; installed
                              from the Arch repositories when missing
  python-numpy      (BSD-3)   icon rendering; installed when missing
  python-pillow     (HPND)    icon rendering; installed when missing
  Qt 6 / Quickshell           the runtime the plugin runs in (part of Omarchy)
  qt6-shadertools   (LGPL/GPL) only to recompile shaders (`qsb`); not needed
                              to run the plugin
  Omarchy logo      (Omarchy) /usr/share/omarchy/icon.png is read from the
                              installed Omarchy, not copied into this repo
  Open-Meteo API    (CC BY 4.0, non-commercial free tier) weather data for the
                              "weather" style; https://open-meteo.com
  wttr.in                     optional IP-based location fallback for the
                              weather style
